  "id": "air-fryer-lemon-pepper-shrimp",
  "name": "Air Fryer Lemon Pepper Shrimp",
  "subtitle": "Quickly seasoned shrimp with bright lemon and pepper.",
  "description": "Tender air-fried shrimp coated in lemon, lemon pepper, paprika, and garlic powder.",
